tor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIMORI NATSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATAGAMI SATORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIGUCHI HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUNO TADAAKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU MASAHARU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKIZAWA KEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIMORI, NATSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATAGAMI, SATORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIGUCHI, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUNO, TADAAKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU, MASAHARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKIZAWA, KEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A color filter includes an ink film colored by ink drops (140) in an opening (111) surrounded by a bank (112) defined on a substrate (110). The bank (112) has a laminated structure including a metal layer (120) on the substrate (110) and a thin photosensitive organic layer (130) thereon. Preferably, the ink contains a solvent with a high boiling point. The border of the bottom of the bank layer can be inside the opaque layer, and the opaque layer can have an exposed portion that is not superposed by the bank layer. The color filter is uniformly colored and provides desired contrast.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un filtre coloré comprenant un film d'encre coloré par des gouttes (140) d'encre dans une ouverture (111) entourée par un bloc (112) formé sur un substrat (110). Le bloc (112) possède une structure laminée comprenant une couche (120) métallique appliquée sur le substrat (110) et sur laquelle repose une couche (130) organique photosensible mince. De préférence, l'encre contient un solvant à point d'ébullition élevé. La limite du fond de la couche du bloc peut se situer à l'intérieure de la couche opaque, cette dernière pouvant avoir une partie exposée qui n'est pas superposée par la couche du bloc. Le filtre est uniformément coloré et assure un contraste désiré.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>